	And I update my phone number as "phone.customer1" to the following values
	| Number  | 5558402834 |
	And I log out of the web homepage
	And I wait for "1" minutes
	Then the user with the email address "phone.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"
	When I log into the web homepage as "phone.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" with password "testtest"
	And I update my phone number as "phone.customer1" to the following values
	| Number | +15554394671 |
	And I log out of the web homepage
	And I wait for "1" minutes
	Then the user with the email address "phone.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should have the phone number "+15554394671"
	And the user with the email address "phone.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on zendesk.liferay.com should not have the phone number "5558402834"

